# Copy this file to account.txt in the project root.
# Keep account.txt private; it is ignored by Git.
# This file is AppState/cookie-only. Never put passwords or 2FA secrets here.
#
# Paste your own exported Facebook cookie header below, for example:
# c_user=YOUR_USER_ID; xs=YOUR_SESSION_COOKIE
#
# You may also use a Netscape cookie export or a JSON cookie array.
# Alternatively, place a JSON cookie array in the root appstate.json file.
#
# Remove the leading '#' from the example line only after replacing both
# placeholder values with cookies from your own authorized Facebook session.
